# Dynamite on Nido's door. ItemAction_Dynamite (ps2.asm:14336): facing an
# event object with index $18-$1A whose event_flags bit 0 is clear, the
# bit is set, "{char} uses DYNAMITE...." ($0001), demo 4 is queued and the
# stick leaves the bag. With the menu closed Demo_DynamiteUsed (5492)
# plays: three idle reads, down three, right, up, idle, then $FD -- the
# door SFX and routine 2 into slot 0, the door, which spawns the burst
# ($2B) on itself and shows its blown frame; routine 3 clears its box.
# The party ends on 54,48 and the gap is open.

start level 27 53 48
wait screen level
wait idle
give Dynamite                # Rolf's bag: Knife CarbonSuit Shoes Dynamite
walk up 2
wait step
expect level 27 53 46
press up                     # face the door
wait ticks 20
press c                      # the C menu: ITEM
wait idle
press c                      # ROLF
wait idle
press c                      # the bag
wait idle
press down
press down
press down                   # DYNAMITE, slot 3
press c
wait idle
press c                      # USE
wait idle
expect script $0001
shot 01_uses
press c                      # the menu closes; the demo runs
wait ticks 100
shot 02_backing_away
wait idle                    # control is back at $FD, the burst just spawned
expect level 27 54 48
shot 03_blast
wait ticks 40
shot 04_blown
walk left 1
wait step
walk up 4                    # 47, 46, 45 (the door's cell), 44
wait step
expect level 27 53 44
shot 05_through
expect no-stderr not ported
